{
  "info": {
    "name": "MCDSS - Phase 4 (Application Forms, Submission, Documents)",
    "description": "Exercises Phase 4 (Persons 1-3 only -- resume parser is JB's separate FastAPI work) from TEAM_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md: form definition, draft/submit application lifecycle, and document upload. Live-verified end-to-end via curl before this collection was written, including: idempotent draft creation, post-submit edit lock, ownership checks, closed-position and applicant-type-mismatch submit rejection, mime/size validation, and file-removed-from-disk on document delete.\n\nPrereqs: `docker compose up -d --build` then `docker compose exec laravel php artisan migrate --seed` (seeds one active hiring_round so applications have somewhere to attach -- see the Phase 4 plan notes on hiring_rounds ownership).\n\nMANUAL STEPS for the Document folder: Postman collections can't embed binary files. Before running '3. Documents', open each upload request's Body tab and attach a real file for the 'file' form field (a real .png/.pdf -- a fake file with the right extension but wrong content, e.g. a renamed .txt, will be correctly rejected by Laravel's `mimes:` check since it validates actual file content, not just the extension).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "mailpit_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8025"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "department_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "position_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "closed_position_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "criterion_numeric_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "criterion_select_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "option_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "applicant_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "applicant_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "second_applicant_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "internal_staff_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "internal_staff_temp_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
